| Free VRAM (NVML or DXGI budget) is checked against an estimate plus the reserve before every batch and every session creation; a resident session is not counted twice | {{ref:vram_check}}, {{ref:vram_estimate}} | `FallbackFixture.LowFreeVramSkipsGpuWithoutCreatingSessions`, `BackendPlan.VramEstimateGrowsWithResolutionAndBatch` | Ran here with a fake GPU; real NVML/DXGI Windows/AE pending |

