| An abandoned in-flight run is stopped with ORT `RunOptions::SetTerminate` | {{ref:terminate}} | `EngineInference.AbortCallbackStopsWaiting` | Ran here |
| Aborted renders return `PF_Interrupt_CANCEL` | {{ref:interrupt}} | mock compile | Mock-compiled |

