| The download runs on an engine worker thread; the dialog only polls progress, with cancel | {{ref:download_worker}} | `Downloader.*` | Ran here |
| SHA-256 is verified before the file is moved into place; resume state is persisted | {{ref:download_verify}} | `Downloader.ResumesAfterDroppedConnection`, `ChecksumMismatchDeletesPartial` | Ran here (real 99 MB DA2 download too) |
| A missing model during render produces gray plus a single message, never a dialog or download | {{ref:render_fallback}} | `PluginCore.MissingModelRendersGrayAndReportsOnce` | Ran here |

