| Odd sizes and sub-rect requests: only the requested rect is written; row padding is untouched | {{ref:subrect}}, {{ref:prerender_rect}} | `PixelDepthTest.RenderWritesExactlyTheOutputWorld`, `PluginCore.OutputOutsideInputIsTransparent` | Ran here |
| Temporal checkouts are capped at 32 frames | {{ref:maxwindow}} | `TemporalWindow.*` | Ran here (core) |

